            "verdict": "candidate",
            "evidence_level": "rule_verified+llm",
            "cwe": "CWE-89",
            "endpoint": "/008",
            "http_method": "GET",
            "has_poc": true,
            "origin": "rule"
          }
        },
        {
          "ruleId": "sunset/sql_injection",
          "level": "error",
          "message": {
            "text": "008.php 用户详情查询处 SQL 注入（CWE-89）\n\n同一外部输入 user_id（008.php:19）在通过存在性检查后继续被拼接到 $query（008.php:35：\"SELECT first_name, last_name, user_id, avatar FROM users WHERE user_id = $id;\"），并在 008.php:36 由 mysqli_query 执行。由于 $id 未做整型化或转义，攻击者可构造 UNION SELECT 直接控制返回列，读取任意表数据。"
          },
          "locations": [
